[{:db/id "55bc9615-3a10-584e-a34c-31b663bcb68a" :answer/id #uuid "55bc9615-3a10-584e-a34c-31b663bcb68a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c3485420-0f9b-591f-a441-d93100d3c590" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3485420-0f9b-591f-a441-d93100d3c590" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["55bc9615-3a10-584e-a34c-31b663bcb68a"] :answer-field/correct "55bc9615-3a10-584e-a34c-31b663bcb68a" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f49ac21a-2d62-566e-a42d-88814c785a3f" :question/id #uuid "f49ac21a-2d62-566e-a42d-88814c785a3f" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{48}}9 \\sin{\\left(24 x \\right)}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=24 x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=24\\,\\Longrightarrow\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{24}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi}{48}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{48}}9 \\sin{\\left(24 x \\right)}\\,\\text{d}x &= {\\int }_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}9\\sin(u)\\cdot \\frac{1}{24}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\ &= \\frac{3}{8}{\\int }_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sin(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\ &= - \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{8}\\big|_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\\\ &= 0-(- \\frac{3}{8}) \\\\ &= \\frac{3}{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["c3485420-0f9b-591f-a441-d93100d3c590"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "76973ccd-ce2c-5c47-9012-95953c70b708" :answer/id #uuid "76973ccd-ce2c-5c47-9012-95953c70b708" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{10}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2ec1cc2e-eb99-5092-9662-f13d832f50bb" :answer-field/id #uuid "2ec1cc2e-eb99-5092-9662-f13